sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Auth as UnifiedAuthService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Audit as Security audit
  Person->>Auth: Connect provider to User U123
  Auth->>DB: Find provider + subject
  DB-->>Auth: Already owned by User U987
  Auth->>Audit: AUTH_IDENTITY_LINK_BLOCKED / IDENTITY_IN_USE
  Auth-->>Person: Connection blocked
  Note over Person,Audit: No identity reassignment and no data merge
